{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:25736b2013cc8a18","name":"Squad Leader Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-25736b2013cc8a18","title":"Squad Leader Talent Tree","revision":20061,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:07:40Z","sha256":"7a678b8fca6c4927d63cbe76604513dfd48bd7eb35c1b0828d8f83a8e04ac3e3","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20061","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Squad%20Leader%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-25736b2013cc8a18","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are a capable military leader who can issue orders to a squad of soldiers with poise and efficiency.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Commanding Officer"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Follower"},". Choose either the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aggressive Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aggressive_Follower","referenceId":"reference:8997870790dd9c1a"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defensive Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defensive_Follower","referenceId":"reference:51d1c3842bf4509b"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Utility Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Utility_Follower"},", generating the follower's statistics using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," rules. This ",{"tag":"a","children":["Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Follower"}," gains one Armor Proficiency feat of your choice and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Rifles)"},", in addition to those provided by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Follower Templates"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Follower_Templates"},". The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Follower"}," must meet the prerequisites for the Armor Proficiency feat you select.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can select this Talent multiple times. Each time you do, you gain one additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Follower"}," (maximum of three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"},").\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Coordinated Tactics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Commanding Officer"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Each of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," gains the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coordinated Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coordinated_Attack","referenceId":"reference:62402b39143dcd42"}," feat, provided he or she meets the prerequisite. If your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Follower"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Follower"}," later meets the prerequisite for the feat, they gain the feat at that time.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Fire at Will"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +5, ",{"tag":"b","children":["Commanding Officer"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", you and one of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against one target (each) in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". You each take a -5 penalty to your attack rolls.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Squad Actions"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Commanding Officer"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You and your squad have learned to work together as a team, and have an established set of tactics that you have practiced to perfection. You can use any of the following actions on your turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Autofire Barrage:"]}," As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," attack against legal target spaces. For each of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," who is armed with a ranged weapon set on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," and has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to the area targeted by your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"},", you can designate one additional square as targeted by your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," (that square must be adjacent to your original target area)."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Open Fire:"]}," As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against a single target. For each of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," who is armed with a ranged weapon and has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to the target, add +2 to your damage roll on a successful hit."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Painted Target:"]}," As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against a single target. You gain a competence bonus on your attack roll equal to the number of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," who are armed with a ranged weapon and have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to the target. Thus, if you have three armed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Followers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Followers","referenceId":"reference:a145ab342a4a3b94"}," with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to the target, you gain a +3 competence bonus on your attack roll."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
